{"4579430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OASIUM", "steam_appid": 4579430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OASIUM is a VR social experience where players explore multiple large-scale worlds, interact with others in shared spaces, and move freely through immersive environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OASIUM features several large, hand-crafted worlds, each with its own environment, scale, and gameplay focus. Explore urban cities, vast desert landscapes, and natural environments by selecting a destination from the hub or menu and entering through portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/6f939cd6841f9093f39204fb99a787e9.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/6f939cd6841f9093f39204fb99a787e9.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VEHICLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across massive environments using a variety of vehicles. Designed for speed and long-distance exploration, vehicles let you experience each world from a different perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/5996b036081e89ad6fa97cf1ce5a4edc.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/5996b036081e89ad6fa97cf1ce5a4edc.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICAL INTERACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OASIUM features immersive VR interactions, including bow hunting and other hands-on activities designed specifically for motion controllers. Every action is performed naturally through movement, aiming, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/f1243b226aa2c9b4a7be049ba4a00804.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/f1243b226aa2c9b4a7be049ba4a00804.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AVATAR SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing collection of unique Avatars, each with its own appearance and style. Switch between Avatars at any time and represent yourself across every world and social space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/22e5a49b5845e575a2f645863aa0fe95.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/22e5a49b5845e575a2f645863aa0fe95.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOCIAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other players in shared hubs and across every world. Chat, explore together, or simply spend time in the same space using real-time voice chat and proximity-based interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/6d78af5f0a3325aabd835c27cbd4f2b6.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/6d78af5f0a3325aabd835c27cbd4f2b6.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OASIUM is a VR social experience where players explore multiple large-scale worlds, interact with others in shared spaces, and move freely through immersive environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OASIUM features several large, hand-crafted worlds, each with its own environment, scale, and gameplay focus. Explore urban cities, vast desert landscapes, and natural environments by selecting a destination from the hub or menu and entering through portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/6f939cd6841f9093f39204fb99a787e9.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/6f939cd6841f9093f39204fb99a787e9.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VEHICLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across massive environments using a variety of vehicles. Designed for speed and long-distance exploration, vehicles let you experience each world from a different perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/5996b036081e89ad6fa97cf1ce5a4edc.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/5996b036081e89ad6fa97cf1ce5a4edc.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICAL INTERACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OASIUM features immersive VR interactions, including bow hunting and other hands-on activities designed specifically for motion controllers. Every action is performed naturally through movement, aiming, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/f1243b226aa2c9b4a7be049ba4a00804.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/f1243b226aa2c9b4a7be049ba4a00804.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AVATAR SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing collection of unique Avatars, each with its own appearance and style. Switch between Avatars at any time and represent yourself across every world and social space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/22e5a49b5845e575a2f645863aa0fe95.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/22e5a49b5845e575a2f645863aa0fe95.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOCIAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other players in shared hubs and across every world. Chat, explore together, or simply spend time in the same space using real-time voice chat and proximity-based interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras/6d78af5f0a3325aabd835c27cbd4f2b6.avif?t=1784866792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/extras_big/6d78af5f0a3325aabd835c27cbd4f2b6.avif?t=1784866792 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "OASIUM is a new immersive social world for PCVR and PC. Explore vast, highly realistic environments, take photos, socialize, and go on adventures together. Help us build an oasis—a universe that belongs to all of us.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/e124b186d6ab87a19110dab12bce73a922c23b7e/header.jpg?t=1784866792", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/63df84ef46619be2bef8ae0df6a19fbfa65c9b0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784866792", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579430/63df84ef46619be2bef8ae0df6a19fbfa65c9b0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784866792", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong>  OpenXR (Valve Index, HTC Vive, Meta Quest via PCVR)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-13700K / AMD Ryzen 7 7700X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 / AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<b